    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Welcome to Arcade Galaxy \u2013 Where Speed Meets Skill, and You\u2019re the Architect of Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a vibrant universe of chaos, creativity, and competition. In Arcade Galaxy, you don\u2019t just play the game \u2014 you create it. Race, jump, climb, and crawl your way through an ever-expanding galaxy of user-generated levels, each one bursting with surprises and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as adorable, customizable animals called &quot;Cubs&quot;, and take on platforming courses that range from lightning-fast speedruns to mind-bending obstacle climbs. Whether you\u2019re chasing world records or just trying not to fall off the map, every level is a new story!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/fccd61c525ce7046e5c8221cfabd39da.poster.avif?t=1755128697\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/fccd61c525ce7046e5c8221cfabd39da.webm?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/fccd61c525ce7046e5c8221cfabd39da.mp4?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build. Break. Share.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use our intuitive level editor to build the platforming experience of your dreams. Create thrilling obstacles, clever traps, even mind boggling labyrinth for the world to challenge. Whether it\u2019s crafting devilishly tricky jumps or designing the perfect run-through for others to beat, the power to shape the galaxy is in your hands.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/08e419525e86c5712670464cdd1e34f4.poster.avif?t=1755128697\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/08e419525e86c5712670464cdd1e34f4.webm?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/08e419525e86c5712670464cdd1e34f4.mp4?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Jump In. Stand Out.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to beat the best times on endless player-created maps, or just have fun exploring and overcoming unique levels at your own pace. Fancy a bit of friendly competition? Share your creations with the world, challenge your friends to complete your custom-designed maps, or take on their wildest creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/24eede67dd3a18c6b98a5d7c8aeecfce.poster.avif?t=1755128697\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/24eede67dd3a18c6b98a5d7c8aeecfce.webm?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/24eede67dd3a18c6b98a5d7c8aeecfce.mp4?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Make It Fashion.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your <i>Cubs</i> to match your unique style. Choose from a vast array of cosmetics and abilities to create a look and playstyle that\u2019s truly your own. This rich customization ensures every player can build a game experience that reflects their personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/82aff679a8634040bce59601439e2647.poster.avif?t=1755128697\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/82aff679a8634040bce59601439e2647.webm?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/82aff679a8634040bce59601439e2647.mp4?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create. Share. Challenge.</strong> Whether you\u2019re building epic levels, breaking records, or sharing laughs with friends, <strong>Arcade Galaxy</strong> is your ticket to endless intergalactic fun. Jump in today and start shaping the universe! \ud83d\ude80 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Endless Challenges:</strong> Play and compete on an ever-growing library of player-made levels. Beat records, or set your own! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/7a7174054727a3f24690d361519c493c.poster.avif?t=1755128697\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/7a7174054727a3f24690d361519c493c.webm?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/7a7174054727a3f24690d361519c493c.mp4?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Build Your Vision:</strong> Design levels with easy-to-use tools and customize every detail, tracks to obstacles!\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/304952a8010f1c560e1f8baa9e416fcb.poster.avif?t=1755128697\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/304952a8010f1c560e1f8baa9e416fcb.webm?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/304952a8010f1c560e1f8baa9e416fcb.mp4?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0e Share Your World:</strong> Publish your creations and challenge the global community to conquer your designs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/81805177c4b3bdd9394f8855e9711a24.poster.avif?t=1755128697\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/81805177c4b3bdd9394f8855e9711a24.webm?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/81805177c4b3bdd9394f8855e9711a24.mp4?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Customize Your Cubs:</strong> Personalize your Cubs with a galaxy of cosmetics and abilities to make them truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/98ca7e8bf5f63aa065530be24af0d018.poster.avif?t=1755128697\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/98ca7e8bf5f63aa065530be24af0d018.webm?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/98ca7e8bf5f63aa065530be24af0d018.mp4?t=1755128697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To the Galaxy now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090620/extras/827167bf6337d9c0a1b0a583424b2f7d.avif?t=1755128697\" width=200 height=129 /></span></p>",
